        "content": "A water main break near Elm Street Station is flooding tracks and platforms, requiring immediate rail service suspension on affected routes. I need operational impact assessment, rider notifications for alternative routes, formal incident documentation, and post-resumption ridership data compilation for the disruption period.",
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
