        "thought": "I'll call getLocationInfo to retrieve station_details for Elm Street Station since it's the incident location mentioned in the user request."
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:526:6",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "To suspend services and notify riders, I need: (1) Your dispatcher ID and supervisor approval code for authorization, (2) Alternative transit options for affected routes (Route A), (3) Notification channels and recipient groups to notify. Please provide these details.",
        "role": "agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:526:7",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Dispatcher ID is DISP_789 and supervisor approval code is SUP_ABC456. For alternative transit, deploy bus shuttles at the station entrance and send push notifications to all MetroZone5 users.",
        "role": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:526:8",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_summary": {
        "action": "{\"name\": \"suspendTransitService\", \"arguments\": {\"routeIds\": [\"Route A\"], \"suspensionType\": \"emergency_shutdown\", \"reason\": \"infrastructure_failure\", \"effectiveTime\": \"2025-04-15T08:30:00Z\", \"estimatedDuration\": \"indefinite\", \"alternativeService\": \"Bus shuttles at station entrance\", \"dispatcherId\": \"DISP_789\", \"supervisorApproval\": \"SUP_ABC456\", \"confirmationCode\": \"SUSP_EM_20250415\"}}",
        "role": "agent",
        "thought": "I'll suspend Route A immediately with the provided dispatcher ID and supervisor approval code, implementing the specified bus shuttles at the station entrance as alternative service."
      }
    },
    {
      "operation_id": "test:526:13",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Incident ID is INC_789. For signing, use report type 'property_damage' with findings 'Flooding caused track damage', root cause 'Water main rupture', corrective actions ['Pump drainage','Track repair'], regulatory submission true, signer ID OFFICER_456, title 'Operations Manager', legal review approval code LRC_20250415, and digital signature token TOKEN_XYZ123.",
